<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News Corp Q3 net profit A$330 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News Corp Q3 net profit A$330 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     330 vs  77</p>
<p>    Abnormals		  loss 46 vs loss 204</p>
<p>NOTE: News Corp Ltd is a film, television and publishing group controlled by interests associated with Rupert Murdoch.  </p>
<p>    Net profit before abnormals    376 vs 281</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   426 vs 299</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		  3.737 vs   3.048</p>
<p>    Operating income		   492 vs 370</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  9.0 vs   2.0</p>
<p>    Tax				     33 vs  19</p>
<p>NOTE - Geographic results by sales in third quarter</p>
<p>    United States		    2,664 vs 2,064</p>
<p>    United Kingdom		     685 vs   591</p>
<p>    Australasia			  388 vs   393</p>
<p>Geographic results by operating income in third quarter</p>
<p>    United States			346 vs   275</p>
<p>    United Kingdom		     137 vs    85</p>
<p>    Australasia			    9 vs    10</p>
<p>    Television			   135 vs  77</p>
<p>    Filmed Entertainment		82 vs  63</p>
<p>    Book pubishing		 loss  9 vs loss 1</p>
<p>    Other			    loss  1 vs profit 3</p>
<p>    Total				  492 vs 370</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
